      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/hindu-succession-act-1956-can-a-grandson-claim-a-share-in-property-inherited-by-his-father-supreme-court-clarifies-11794320294195.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
