       <h1>Indie Publisher Vendetta Announces 2027 Slate and Advisory Board</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Indie game publisher Vendetta has revealed its 2027 release lineup, featuring the highly anticipated &quot;Surfpunk,&quot; the co-op title &quot;Killing Things with Your Friends,&quot; and the cozy adventure game &quot;The Mailroom.&quot; These titles reflect a diverse range of gaming experiences slated for the upcoming year.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-10/indie-publisher-vendetta-announces-2027-slate-and-advisory-b.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>To guide its future growth, Vendetta has also established a new advisory board. The board consists of industry leaders representing music, game development, anime, and Hollywood communications, signaling a strategic effort to integrate expertise from various entertainment sectors into the publisher's operations.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the source without adding external speculation.</p>
