     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-11-10 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kareena Kapoor Khan and Family Celebrate Diwali in Traditional Style</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Kareena Kapoor Khan shared portraits of her family’s Diwali celebrations, showcasing a sophisticated departure from traditional festive wear. Kareena wore an embellished, floor-length georgette kaftan gown in nude-beige, featuring silver gota patti, sequin latticework, and a matching turban-style headpiece. She accessorized the ensemble with a polki choker featuring emerald accents and opted for soft bronzed makeup.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-10/kareena-kapoor-khan-and-family-celebrate-diwali-in-tradition.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Saif Ali Khan appeared in a monochromatic black Pathani-style kurta, while their sons, Taimur and Jeh, added vibrant color to the portraits in marigold-orange and crimson-red silk kurtas, respectively. The family photographs were set against a terrace decorated with bougainvillea and garden sculptures, marking the festival with a blend of contemporary and traditional aesthetics.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Excellent summary that captures the descriptive details of the fashion and setting provided in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/kareena-kapoor-khan-stuns-in-an-embellished-beige-kaftan-gown-as-she-celebrates-diwali-with-saif-ali-khan-taimur-and-jeh/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
