     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-10 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>NDA Alliance Secures Victory in Tirupati Local Body Elections</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The TDP-led National Democratic Alliance achieved a decisive victory in Tirupati’s ZPTC and MPTC elections. The TDP secured 25 ZPTC seats, while alliance partners BJP and Jana Sena won three combined, leaving the YSRCP with six seats. In MPTC contests, the alliance totaled 344 seats compared to the YSRCP's 86.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-10/nda-alliance-secures-victory-in-tirupati-local-body-election.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Despite the regional success, the TDP faced setbacks in Chief Minister Nara Chandrababu Naidu’s native constituency, Chandragiri, where the YSRCP captured three mandals. Attention has now shifted to the Zilla Parishat Chairperson election, with doctor Panabaka Chetana emerging as a leading candidate for the role following her unanimous ZPTC victory in Srikalahasti rural.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately synthesizes the election results and regional nuances provided in the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/tdp-led-nda-dominates-tirupati-district-in-zptcmptc-elctions/article71686572.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/tirupati/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tirupati</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-10/nda-alliance-secures-victory-in-tirupati-local-body-election" data-title="NDA Alliance Secures Victory in Tirupati Local Body Elections"><b>Share:</b>
