     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-11-10 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>'Told my dad I will get a big hundred' - Aaryavir Sehwag after mammoth 160 vs UAE in Under-19 Asia Cup</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#India U-19</span> <span>#Aaryavir Sehwag</span> <span>#U-19 Asia Cup</span></div>
       <p>Aaryavir Sehwag’s stunning 160 off 168 balls at Al Amerat in Oman on November 10 powered India U-19 to a 70-run victory over UAE in the U-19 Asia Cup group stage. This match-winning performance secured India’s berth in the semifinals. His innings was the defining contribution in India’s total of 309 for 7, featuring 17 fours and 7 sixes.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-10/told-my-dad-i-will-get-a-big-hundred-aaryavir-sehwag-after-m.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Sehwag took 14 balls to get off the mark before accelerating, reaching his fifty off 69 balls and then his maiden hundred in Youth ODIs off 131 balls. He was eventually caught at mid-wicket off Naseem Khan in the 45th over. VK Vineeth also contributed a brisk 67 off 69 balls to help India past 300. In reply, UAE were bowled out for 239, with Ahmed Khudabad top-scoring for them with 74 off 74 balls.</p><p>After the match, Aaryavir, son of former India opener Virender Sehwag, spoke about a personal commitment. &quot;I told my dad I will get a big hundred. I have a legacy to live up to as he only likes big hundreds,&quot; he said, as quoted by The Indian Express, honouring a promise made before the innings. He had previously shown his quality in the tournament, remaining unbeaten on 72 as India beat Nepal by 10 wickets.</p><p>Addressing the turning Al Amerat surface, Aaryavir explained his strategy: &quot;The wicket was turning a little. I started off and decided to play long and bat for 40-odd overs. There were challenges on the wicket. I didn't get bothered about the dot balls, as I knew I would catch up.&quot; This innings, combined with his 72 against Nepal, makes him India U-19's standout batter heading into the U-19 Asia Cup semifinals.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Excellent, comprehensive report that utilizes all facts from the source text effectively.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/told-my-dad-i-will-get-a-big-hundred-aaryavir-sehwag-after-mammoth-160-vs-uae-in-under-19-asia-cup/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
